Invoice which, unlike many municipalities, is also regulated by taxpayers, and not by merchant associations.
To lighten its costs, the city uses LEDs.
But also a differentiated management of the public lighting network and Christmas decorations.
Los Angeles airport evacuated after shooting
A shooting took place at Los Angeles International Airport.
It was 10:00 a.m. local time when a man opened fire.
According to the local police, there were at least 2 injured.
This would be an employee working for the U.S. Transportation Safety Authority (TSA) and the shooter.
